      "content": "it's not just about the next five minutes though. that's just delaying the inevitable. if the world has already decided i don't belong, if i'm basically a ghost... why am i still fighting to stay? it feels like i'm just performing a role for an audience that isn't even there. it's like i'm just a memory that forgot to fade away.",
